Arrange the clock, stats and other panels full screen
Tap the grid button at the bottom right
Long-press a module to edit the layout
Everything but the grid fades, so empty cells show as outlines
Tap + Add for a new one
Tap Shelf & books to narrow the list
Tap Ornament to pick a piece from your packs
Tap Count's Companion
No room on the first page, so it starts a new one
Width and Height + make it bigger
The arrows move it a cell at a time
Tap Done to keep the layout
Swipe right to go back a page
